"by the courts of our land, so the Mosaic Constitution needs to be applied to"
" new situations as well (e.g.: What do we do with all of the laws related to"
" the Temple, now that there is no Temple?)."
msgstr ""
"Net zoals de grondwet van de Verenigde Staten door de rechtbanken van ons "
